OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's emergency room gets
OL,4,Ajungle revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital waiting area has been given
OL,7,Fa makeover funded by a charity set up
OL,8,Fin memory of a boy who died from a
OL,9,Fbrain tumour.
OL,11,FTime is Precious was founded by Neil
OL,12,Fand Nicky Halford MBE after their son
OL,13,FBen died in 2010 aged three.
OL,15,FThe charity has refurbished the
OL,16,Fchildren's emergency department waiting
OL,17,Farea at the Royal United Hospital (RUH)
OL,18,Fin Bath by creating a colourful
OL,19,Fjungle-themed space designed to ease
OL,20,Fthe anxiety of young patients and their
OL,21,Ffamilies.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
